    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d436">

                <pb facs="1069" n="1057" sameAs="frus:frus1945v02/pg1057"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">840.50 UNRRA/12–1745: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Italy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Kirk</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-12-29">December 29,
                        1945</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2458. Following submitted reurtel 4093, December 17.<anchor n="57"
                        xml:id="d436-f1"/>
                </p>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>Some two years ago Congress authorized contribution of
                            $1,350,000,000<anchor n="58" xml:id="d436-f2"/> but appropriated only
                        $800 million to UNRRA.<anchor n="59" xml:id="d436-f3"/>
                    </item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>In December 1945 Congress authorized second contribution of $1,350
                            million.<anchor n="60" xml:id="d436-f4"/>
                    </item>
                    <label>3.</label>
                    <item>In December 1945 Congress appropriated (<hi rendition="#italic">a</hi>)
                        $550 million still due on first authorization<anchor n="61" xml:id="d436-f5"
                        /> (<hi rendition="#italic">b</hi>) $750 million of second
                            authorization.<anchor n="62" xml:id="d436-f6"/> Therefore, total
                        authorized to date is $2,700 million, total appropriated to date $2,100
                        million balance $600 million, still to be appropriated.<anchor n="63"
                            xml:id="d436-f7"/>
                    </item>
                </list>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
